1.0.0-1 (2026-11-15)
- Initial native Qt6 player: clue navigation, undo/redo, checks, reveals, pause,
  atomic saved progress, portable saves, and six original offline crosswords.
- Browse and download Crosshare daily minis and Brendan Emmett Quigley puzzles.
- Keep downloaded puzzles offline and resume their saved progress.
- Add clearly labeled official-player links for NYT and TV Guide / TV Insider.
- Read standard ipuz and Across Lite files; reject unsupported puzzle variants.
